WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.500
Every head of state
has this box, -

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
- to call his staff who are
sitting in the room next door.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.500
When a head of state has a question
he presses the red button, -

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.500
and automatically the country
that has been called appears on a screen.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
There is no direct communication
with the meeting room, -

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.500
- because the debate among the heads of state
is confidential.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
At the moment we are installing
a button for each head of state, -

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.000
- according to the seating plan we have received.

